{"t": 1794110660.8854742, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix.\n\nRoot cause: Android keyboards submit promo codes with surrounding/inner spaces and lower-case letters (Sentry CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q: `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, 2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2). Codes are stored upper-case without spaces, so the raw input never matched.\n\nChange: `checkout/promo.py` \u2014 `normalize_code()` now removes all whitespace (surrounding and inner) and upper-cases the code before lookup.\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'Autumn24'`, `'AUTUMN 24'` and `'\\tAutumn 24\\n'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`; already-clean codes are unchanged.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
